WEBVTT

00:11:30.006 --> 00:11:33.236
For example, when a comet hits the Sun,

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:35.728
the Sun carries on just as before,

00:11:35.752 --> 00:11:37.950
but the comet is vaporized.

00:11:38.657 --> 00:11:40.514
For the same reason,

00:11:40.538 --> 00:11:47.109
big things are not much affected
by small parts of themselves,

00:11:47.133 --> 00:11:48.910
i.e., by details.

00:11:49.609 --> 00:11:52.672
Which means that their overall behavior

00:11:52.696 --> 00:11:53.846
is simple.

00:11:54.165 --> 00:11:57.561
And since nothing very new
can happen to things

00:11:57.585 --> 00:11:59.323
that remain simple,

00:11:59.347 --> 00:12:04.652
the hierarchy rule,
by causing large-scale simplicity,